+{"id": "arora-h_inbox_83", "subject": "ConEd - Lakewood Peaker", "email_body": "Harry:  Got the bid documents for ConEd's offering of peaking capacity for PJM East (Lakewood, New Jersey).\nCan't imagine they would entertain an Enron bid right now without confiscatory credit pricing.\nDo you want to bid anyway?\nLet me know.", "author": "unknown.sender@external.com", "to": "arora-h@enron.com"}
+{"id": "lay-k_inbox_65", "subject": "CAFC Ruling on 2003 Prozac Patent", "email_body": "We learned today that the Court of Appeals for the Federal Circuit has modified its opinion of August 9, 2000 in which it found the 2003 Prozac patent invalid for double patenting.\nIn essence, the Court has again ruled that the patent is invalid for double patenting, but has used a different analysis to reach this conclusion.\nWe intend to seek legal review of today's decision.\nAlthough it is possible that the legal review process could delay Barr from entering the market on August 3, we continue to plan for Barr launching generic fluoxetine at that time.", "author": "unknown.sender@external.com", "to": "lay-k@enron.com"}
+{"id": "campbell-l_inbox_938", "subject": "New Class-HTML Basics", "email_body": "A new class on HTML Basics will be offered on September 14 from 8:30-11:30 am.\nThis class is for beginners.\nThe topics to be included are:  Text Appearance and alignment Paragraphs and Line Breaks Hyperlinks within Web Site Linking with Named Anchors Linking to an Email Address Placing Graphics on a Page Graphics Images with Hyperlinks Arranging Text in Lists Formatting Lists with Symbols and Numbers  You can register for the class at elm.enron.com.\nIf you have difficulty registering, please call ext.\n31816 for assistance.", "author": "unknown.sender@external.com", "to": "campbell-l@enron.com"}
+{"id": "skilling-j_inbox_82", "subject": "Forrester Research's Online Energy Trading, free analyst breakfast,  Houston, May 2, 2001, limited availability", "email_body": "Hello,  Below is invite to Forrester Research's complimentary May 2nd energy breakfast.\nLimited availability.\nPlease share with anyone else in your organization interested in attending.\nYou can sign-up via the link below.\nWhen signing up, hit continue if the screen asks for a \"reservation code\".\nMy contact information is below if you have any questions.\nOnline wholesale trade will reach $3.6 trillion in 2005 -- dominated by", "author": "unknown.sender@external.com", "to": "skilling-j@enron.com"}
+{"id": "ybarbo-p_inbox_597", "subject": "Year End Accomplishments", "email_body": "It is that time of year....\nPlease complete your list of accomplishments by the end of November.\nAlso, please complete your 2002 Objectives by December 14.\nYour objectives will need to outline your specific marketing plan for each customer, project and idea you may have for adding/increasing value to Transwestern in 2002.\nAs discussed earlier, we will get together in mid-December to review account loads to see if we need to do any shifting.\nYour 2002 Objectives will be helpful in determining whether your load is heavy, light or just right.\nI will be happy to visit with each of you individually if you have any questions or would like to discuss these items.\n:>)  Thanks,", "author": "unknown.sender@external.com", "to": "ybarbo-p@enron.com"}
