+{"id": "tycholiz-b_inbox_256", "subject": "Updated: Dun & Bradstreet Data", "email_body": "When: Thursday, September 20, 2001 1:00 PM-2:30 PM (GMT-06:00) Central Time (US & Canada).\nWhere: 3AC 9C1  *~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*   RESCHEDULED.\nThanks for your patience.\nAt this meeting, Dun & Bradstreet representative Karen Marcom will provide an overview of the Dun & Bradstreet marketing data that Enron will have access to through a global purchase agreement.\nThis data set is a monthly feed of marketing information, financial stress scores, energy demand estimators, family tree linkage and D&B credit scores, which is a subset of the full D&B database.\nKaren will answer questions concerning the presentation of the data and how it will be accessed.\nThe Dun & Bradstreet database will be available to business units sharing in the cost of the database.", "author": "unknown.sender@external.com", "to": "tycholiz-b@enron.com"}
